<title>NEW ZEALAND: St Lukes sees flat earnings in second half.</title>
<headline>St Lukes sees flat earnings in second half.</headline>
<dateline>WELLINGTON 1996-02-14</dateline>
<text>
<p>Property company St Lukes Group Ltd said on Friday operating earnings will further improve over the next six months with the completion of the WestCity development.</p>
<p>&quot;However an increase in funding costs will result in a flat earnings position over the six months to June 30.&quot;</p>
</text>
